{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10241050","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10241050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1024105001:0":{"text":"お兄さん、掲示板の黒いアヒルを見たことがあるのか？","source_cn":"小哥，你有见过告示板上那只黑鸭吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC13C3FB39C5D34F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1024105002:0":{"text":"ブラドックはアヒルじゃ――","source_cn":"布拉达克不是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D4DC4DE53F44D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1024105003:0":{"text":"しーっ。ここは俺に任せなって。","source_cn":"嘘，小少爷，问话就交给我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97894AC8B07975CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1024105004:0":{"text":"あのアヒルを探してるのはあんたたちか！","source_cn":"原来是你们在找那只鸭子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC28664BDC9088488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1024105005:0":{"text":"間違いないよ。数日前、俺んちの穀倉を走り回ってたんだ！目が合ったら、こっちをあざ笑うかのようにガーガー鳴いてさ！","source_cn":"就是它，几天前在我家的谷仓乱转！看到它的时候，它竟然还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5998B3C2E49767B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say: